			"notes": "Fixes the crash at launch on Minecraft 26.2 introduced by 2.8.0.\n\n### Fixed\n- **26.2 crashed at startup** as soon as the mod loaded. 2.8.0's Fish Collection\n  tab injected into `AdvancementsScreen` using 26.1's method signatures, and\n  26.2 changed all three of them, so mixin refused the descriptor and the game\n  died at `Initializing game`. The tab is now a version-gated mixin pair and\n  applies correctly on both.\n- **New-catch toasts** referenced `Minecraft.getToastManager()`, which does not\n  exist on 26.2 (it moved to the Gui). Resolved by name at runtime, so it works\n  on both.\n\n26.1.x was unaffected by the crash and behaves as before.\n\nThanks to @MrCookie112 for the report and a clean crash log."
		}
